<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces now control the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have captured Buurhakaba and another town in the Bay region, extending combat in southern Somalia. Al Shabaab detonated an IED in Mandera, injuring six civilians, and a senior al-Shabaab figure was killed by Somali intelligence. Heavy fighting erupted near Baidoa and in Burijeed as Laftagareen forces attacked army positions, prompting UN calls to halt the fighting amid famine, displacement and flood risks. Ethiopia has withdrawn more than 3,000 troops and will not intervene in the South West State conflict, and a UAE drone strike in Puntland killed four family members, including a pregnant teenager. 2,284 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPc0x4OF8wRmZ1bXpWV0ZQSnYybHJMSF81Q3NFUEVKa0piSzRJQkNGMXl3TmUxQlJZb181ZDZzRGkxVkpia3ZLd0VmQlFxeWNaZ01jYU5EbWQ3ampYeWFuSnpraVBMVzlCQ0hNaXhXSm5yc0d3M2h2NFBVSzR1Tm52dk4wdGNmbGJIVFVBM3lZZUtTdm8wVVBXcThB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQSVk5c1Q3X1BKU0h0dXZJUTNOaVpSR080QkhuOEJFbHYyeWctbTJXYVVKbHpVY0FoZFhNQ2xFRjRKeVdTNmRDbzZOWlQyRHFseGtWXzd2ZHM3amxGcjl3ZWpTYnNHTjhzOEdtYW5EVlo4TDZySkNiSGtTNGUxZzJqc1A3ZDdJY1Ztc1p3eTB3Sy03MHRPcTlhdHJLbTdWcnVaMk9pZG1SVjgyRktNa21nN0lZSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOQjVlUUZjek4xcXZhdFZNM3V4czJ3eEhwYkk3d3cyc1ZQQ3U4UzY1c2NQSUNSLVVGNGFoeGs2a0JOdnpGMWljVHNETnEyUzF1Tk5faGJJRmZGWmx2NXlWQjZaeUpHdEg5Vlppd3NmaVFBWEFsbVZadllkOTZLSkdtT0Jrang?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNY3B6Z0JTNGhFbzNCanhMNVh4bTVsMFpWWU5VenFYYmdyR2NXenNiZkt1S1dKaFZDYWVVdTlwOVpsWDR3